    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-model-fidelity>,
