    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-tracheal-viscous-fingering-audit-v2-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-tracheal-viscous-fingering-audit-v2-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-2>,
