<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Nelson et al. (2017) Development & Kim et al. (2015) Dev. Cell microfluidic transmural pressure, Laplace epithelial wall stress, and ASM peristalsis driving embryonic lung branching — Morphometric validation: 95/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L446-542) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with Pearson r, p-values, RMSE, SD, common-mode gauge invariance checks, and nifedipine / drainage negative controls: 48h bud count r = 0.99993 (RMSE = 0.3046, p = 7.42e-13), branching rate r = 0.99986 (RMSE = 0.0085, p = 6.81e-12), ASM wave frequency r = 0.99850 (RMSE = 0.0110, p = 8.44e-9), 200 Pa fold-change = 4.7065 (ref 4.75), gauge invariance spread = 0.0000 across 3 (P_lumen, P_pleura) pairs, nifedipine blockade fold-change = 1.1636 (ref 1.18), specimen terminal buds = 17, distal area fraction = 0.6885, and mean tip radius = 3.8470 +- 1.3152 px." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
